    <div class="stars-container" id="stars-container"></div>

<!-- Rock Group Left -->
    <div class="rock-group rock-group-left" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero-rock rock-a"></div>
      <div class="hero-rock rock-b"></div>
      <div class="hero-rock rock-c"></div>
    </div>
    <!-- Rock Group Right -->
    <div class="rock-group rock-group-right" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero-rock rock-d"></div>
      <div class="hero-rock rock-e"></div>
      <div class="hero-rock rock-f"></div>
    </div>

    <nav class="hero-nav">
      <button class="hamburger md:hidden" id="hamburger" aria-label="Menu">
        <span class="hamburger-line"></span>
        <span class="hamburger-line"></span>
        <span class="hamburger-line"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
        <a href="#who" class="nav-link">Who's This For</a>
        <a href="#services" class="nav-link">Services</a>
        <a href="#portfolio" class="nav-link">Projects</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="nav-link">Work With Me</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="hero-content">

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Conjure high-converting systems into your empire
      </h1>

    </div>

    <div class="scroll-prompt" id="scroll-prompt" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="scroll-prompt-text">Begin thy scrolling, sire</span>
      <svg class="scroll-prompt-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- ─── WHO IS THIS FOR ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section id="who" class="who-section">
    <!-- brick wall background with clip-path (separate so ornament isn't clipped) -->
    <div class="who-wall-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- top-left corner ornament -->
    <img src="/frame 1.png" alt="" class="who-rune-tl" aria-hidden="true" />

    <h2 class="who-heading">I'm not here to "write you emails"</h2>

    <div class="who-grid">
      <p class="who-cell-a">I'm a copywriter &amp; conversion strategist and I'm not here to hand you a few deliverables like emails or scripts and disappear. I am here to build you high-converting systems to help you generate more sales, save you time and help connect with your ideal audience so you can focus on the important aspects of your business.</p>
      <!-- empty top-right cell -->
      <span></span>
      <!-- bottom-left: raven sigil -->
      <img src="https://ik.imagekit.io/greenraven/Green%20Raven/Green%20Raven.png?updatedAt=1766511556233" alt="" class="who-sigil" id="who-sigil" aria-hidden="true" />
      <p class="who-cell-b">While I leverage powerful and advanced tools like AI to reduce friction and produce high-quality work faster, AI never replaces my creative thinking and human instincts — as everything is still being written and double checked by me.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── SERVICES ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section id="services" class="services-section">
    <div class="services-container">
      <h2 class="section-heading">And that's exactly what I'm here to do</h2>
      <div class="carousel-track-wrap">
      <div id="tab-services" class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon-wrap"><span class="service-icon-ring"></span><Icon name="lucide:crosshair" class="service-icon" /></div>
          <div class="service-card-body">
            <h3 class="service-card-title">Identifying ICP &amp; Strategy</h3>
            <p class="service-card-text">Before I start building anything, I begin by creating the ICP (ideal customer profile), which is the main foundation that determines what strategy I need to implement, maps out all objections, and surfaces the different angles I can test.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon-wrap"><span class="service-icon-ring"></span><Icon name="lucide:megaphone" class="service-icon" /></div>
          <div class="service-card-body">
            <h3 class="service-card-title">Bringing In the Traffic</h3>
            <p class="service-card-text">This is done through scripting scroll-stopping short form ads that catch the attention of cold prospects and bring them into my funnel to turn them into buying customers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon-wrap"><span class="service-icon-ring"></span><Icon name="lucide:layout" class="service-icon" /></div>
          <div class="service-card-body">
            <h3 class="service-card-title">Conversion Assets</h3>
            <p class="service-card-text">These are the web pages where I send cold prospects to convert them into subscribers or paying customers like landing pages, sales pages, lead magnets, tripwire pages, VSL landing pages.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon-wrap"><span class="service-icon-ring"></span><Icon name="lucide:mail" class="service-icon" /></div>
          <div class="service-card-body">
            <h3 class="service-card-title">Nurturing Campaigns</h3>
            <p class="service-card-text">This is done by collecting a list of cold subscribers and followers, then nurturing them through email marketing or social media content to build their trust and turn them into buying customers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon-wrap"><span class="service-icon-ring"></span><Icon name="lucide:presentation" class="service-icon" /></div>
          <div class="service-card-body">
            <h3 class="service-card-title">Webinar Events</h3>
            <p class="service-card-text">This is one of the best funnel strategies to earn trust in front of cold strangers and convert them into paid leads. It's done by building a presentation framework that connects the offer to the target avatar's pain points and desires.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon-wrap"><span class="service-icon-ring"></span><Icon name="lucide:search" class="service-icon" /></div>
          <div class="service-card-body">
            <h3 class="service-card-title">Visibility &amp; AI Recognition</h3>
            <p class="service-card-text">More people now search through AI instead of browsing the internet directly, which means SEO ranking alone is no longer enough. GEO (generative engine optimization) is now required so AI can find my pages and understand who I am, who I help, and how.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div><!-- end carousel-track-wrap -->
    </div>
  </section>

